---
import PrivacyPolicy from '@/components/commons/PrivacyPolicy.astro';
import SectionTitle from '@/components/commons/SectionTitle.astro';
---

<section class="space-y-6">
  <div class="px-6">
    <SectionTitle>Solicita presupuesto disfrutar de tu expericia con ramos florales</SectionTitle>
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-2 md:px-10 text-justify text-floral-dark/80 leading-relaxed space-y-4">
      <p>
        Una vez enviada la solicitud, recibirás un correo electrónico de control. Posteriormente, contactaremos contigo por el medio que nos hayas indicado.
      </p>
    </div>
    <br/>
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-2 md:px-10 text-justify text-floral-dark/80 leading-relaxed space-y-4">
      <form id="formularioReserva" class="w-full" novalidate>
        <div class="flex-1 text-center">
        <h2 class="font-display text-4xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4 tracking-wide pb-0 sm:pb-12 md:pb-12">
         Datos necesarios para comenzar a disfrutar de experiencias florales:
        </h2>
        <div 
        id="message-success" 
        class="hidden flex items-center gap-2 p-2.5 mt-2 text-green-700 bg-green-50 border border-green-200 rounded-md transition-all duration-200 ease-in-out"
        role="alert">
        <div class="flex-shrink-0 text-green-500">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-5 w-5" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor">
            <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <span class="text-sm font-medium"></span>
        </div>
        
        <div class="flex-1 text-center">
        <p class="indent-2 font-body text-base text-gray-600 leading-relaxed text-justify tracking-wide">
            <label for="nombre" class="block text-[#2c3e50] mb-2">Nombre (*):</label>
            <input type="text" id="nombre" class="w-full px-4 py-2 border border-gray-300 focus:outline-none focus:border-black">
            <div 
            id="error-nombre" 
            class="hidden flex items-center gap-1.5 text-red-600 transition-all duration-200 ease-in-out"
            role="alert" >
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-4 w-4 shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 8v4m0 4h.01M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" />
            </svg>
            <span class="text-xs font-medium italic">Este campo es obligatorio.</span>
          </div>
        </p>
        <br />
        <p class="indent-2 font-body text-base text-gray-600 leading-relaxed text-justify tracking-wide">
          <label for="telefono" class="block text-[#2c3e50] mb-2">Teléfono (*):</label>
          <input type="tel" id="telefono" class="w-full px-4 py-2 border border-gray-300 focus:outline-none focus:border-black">
          <div 
          id="error-telefono" 
          class="hidden flex items-center gap-1.5 text-red-600 transition-all duration-200 ease-in-out"
          role="alert" >
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-4 w-4 shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 8v4m0 4h.01M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" />
          </svg>
          <span class="text-xs font-medium italic">Este campo es obligatorio.</span>
        </div>
        </p>
        <br />
        <p class="indent-2 font-body text-base text-gray-600 leading-relaxed text-justify tracking-wide">
            <label for="email" class="block text-[#2c3e50] mb-2">Email (*):</label>
            <input type="email" id="email" class="w-full px-4 py-2 border border-gray-300 focus:outline-none focus:border-black">
            <div 
          id="error-email" 
          class="hidden flex items-center gap-1.5 text-red-600 transition-all duration-200 ease-in-out"
          role="alert" >
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-4 w-4 shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 8v4m0 4h.01M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" />
          </svg>
          <span class="text-xs font-medium italic">Este campo es obligatorio.</span>
        </div>
        </p>
        <br />
        <p class="indent-2 font-body text-base text-gray-600 leading-relaxed text-justify tracking-wide">
            <label for="mensaje" class="block text-[#2c3e50] mb-2">Observacones:</label>
            <textarea id="mensaje" rows="5" class="w-full px-4 py-2 border border-gray-300 focus:outline-none focus:border-black"></textarea>
            <div 
            id="error-mensaje" 
            class="hidden flex items-center gap-1.5 text-red-600 transition-all duration-200 ease-in-out"
            role="alert" >
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-4 w-4 shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 8v4m0 4h.01M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" />
            </svg>
            <span class="text-xs font-medium italic">Este campo es obligatorio.</span>
          </div>
        </p>
        </div>
        <PrivacyPolicy>
          <div class="md:flex">
            <div class="my-8 md:flex-1 md:text-center  md:text-end md:mx-8">
              <button type="submit" class="bg-black text-white font-bold py-3 px-8 rounded-full uppercase px-10">Enviar solicitud</button>
            </div>
            <div class="my-8 md:flex-1 text-center md:text-start md:mx-8">
              <a href="/experiencias/" 
              class="inline-block bg-black text-white font-bold py-3 px-8 rounded-full hover:bg-gray-800 transition-transform active:scale-95 px-12">
              Volver
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </PrivacyPolicy>
      </form>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>